title: The Trzaskowski freebie realignment

@freebie_2023_aftermath
# scenario-ledger: TRZ-FR-01
# prose-audit: Grade A — The government result, enacted law and competing right-wing organisations are established before Lewica responds, and each response has a distinct institutional aftermath.
title: The right decides who failed it
subtitle: The 2023 government determines whether succession becomes a rout or a long siege
