@freebie_suwerenna_crossing
# scenario-ledger: TRZ-FR-02
# prose-audit: Grade A — Suwerenna's legal state and recorded mandates determine what can cross, while both responses preserve the seat ledger and expose administrative consequences.
title: The last United Right office changes its sign
subtitle: A legal party may cross whole; a dissolved party can send only the MPs who declare themselves
face-image: img/poland/events/jaroslaw-kaczynski-2023.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event, poland_event_reactive
priority: 29
order: 19
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year >= 2024 and trz_freebie_law != "" and trz_freebie_realign_pressure >= 45 and trz_freebie_suwerenna_done = 0 and (suwerenna_walkout = 1 or suwerenna_merged = 1 or suwerenna_merger_result != "No merger talks yet")
on-arrival: {!
const solidarna = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
    return record && record.id == "solidarna";
});
const recorded = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.round(Number(solidarna && solidarna.sejm_mps !== undefined
        ? solidarna.sejm_mps
        : solidarna && solidarna.mp_count) || 0)
);
const standalone = Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.suwerenna_seats) || 0));
const mergedRoute = Q.suwerenna_merged ||
    Q.suwerenna_merger_result == "Full merger into PiS";
let moving = standalone;
if (moving <= 0) {
    moving = mergedRoute
        ? Math.round(recorded / 3)
        : recorded;
    moving = Math.min(
        Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0)),
        moving
    );
    Q.pis_seats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.pis_seats) - moving);
} else {
    Q.suwerenna_seats = Math.max(0, standalone - moving);
}
Q.konf_seats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.konf_seats) || 0) + moving;
Q.trz_freebie_suwerenna_done = 1;
Q.trz_freebie_suwerenna_route = mergedRoute ? "jaki_current" : "whole_party";
Q.trz_freebie_suwerenna_seats = moving;
Q.suwerenna_own_list = 0;
if (!mergedRoute) Q.suwerenna_walkout = 1;
if (solidarna) {
    solidarna.active = 1;
    solidarna.allied = 1;
    solidarna.independent = 0;
    solidarna.bloc = "konf";
    solidarna.parent = "Konfederacja";
    solidarna.list_committee = "konf";
    solidarna.club = "konf";
    solidarna.in_cabinet = 0;
    solidarna.support_mode = "opposition";
    solidarna.exclusive_seats = 0;
    solidarna.sejm_mps = moving;
    solidarna.mp_count = moving;
    if (mergedRoute) {
        solidarna.kind = "caucus";
        solidarna.name = "Jaki sovereigntist current";
        solidarna.leader = "Patryk Jaki";
        solidarna.legal_status =
            "declared current inside the Konfederacja parliamentary family";
    } else {
        solidarna.kind = "party";
        solidarna.name = "Suwerenna Polska";
        solidarna.legal_status =
            "federated legal party inside Konfederacja";
    }
}
if (Q.government_party == "pis" && Q.government_has_confidence &&
    !Q.caretaker_government) {
    Q.government_support_seats = Math.max(
        0,
        (Number(Q.government_support_seats) || 0) - moving
    );
    Q.coalition_seats = Math.max(
        0,
        (Number(Q.coalition_seats) || 0) - moving
    );
}
Q.united_right_cohesion -= mergedRoute ? 7 : 12;
Q.konf_nationalist_share += 5;
Q.konf_normalisation += 4;
Q.far_right_fragmentation += 10;
Q.trz_freebie_realign_pressure += 8;
Q.news_headline = mergedRoute
    ? "Patryk Jaki's declared MPs leave PiS for the Konfederacja family"
    : "Suwerenna Polska federates with Konfederacja";
!}

= A party office, a prosecutors' network and [+ trz_freebie_suwerenna_seats +] mandates

[? if trz_freebie_suwerenna_route = "whole_party": Suwerenna Polska keeps its
legal treasury and internal board but exchanges the United Right for the
Konfederacja federation. Its **[+ trz_freebie_suwerenna_seats +] MPs** enter
the Konf parliamentary count; no second Suwerenna line remains beside them.?]

[? if trz_freebie_suwerenna_route = "jaki_current": The party dissolved into
PiS, so it cannot walk out whole. Patryk Jaki publishes signatures from **[+
trz_freebie_suwerenna_seats +] MPs** and takes only that declared current into
Konfederacja. The former party's remaining networks stay where they were.?]

The transfer matters beyond the chamber. Lawyers who learned to turn ministry
instructions into disciplinary proceedings now teach county councillors how
to turn refusal of the Trzaskowski law into paperwork. Konfederacja gains a
state-trained culture-war machine and another faction that expects list places.

- @freebie_suwerenna_ledger
- @freebie_suwerenna_services

