    : "PSL makes cooperation conditional on excluding Braunists";
!}

= A budget vote without a photograph

PSL councillors begin with roads, school buses and the chair of an audit
committee. The national board calls each agreement local. By the fifth county,
the same lawyers are using the same template.

[? if psl_konf_partner_line = "open": PSL authorises an open parliamentary
channel and includes future cabinet arithmetic in its brief.?][? if
psl_konf_partner_line = "conditional": Braun's current remains too expensive
to defend, so PSL offers cooperation only after its exclusion. Konfederacja is
being asked to become acceptable, not being kept outside.?]

- @freebie_psl_expose
- @freebie_psl_rural_offer
- @freebie_psl_dismiss

