    : "KO authorises issue-by-issue talks with Konfederacja";
!}

= The exception becomes a procedure

The first interview was defended as access to an electorate. The first common
vote was defended as arithmetic. KO now circulates a note explaining which
economic and security portfolios could be negotiated without accepting
Konfederacja's whole programme.

[? if ko_konf_partner_line = "governing": Sikorski's office owns the channel.
Its proposition is that Atlanticism, ministerial discipline and a published
compact can make the radical right usable.?][? if ko_konf_partner_line =
"talks": KO still refuses a cabinet commitment, but no longer treats talks
themselves as a breach of the democratic firewall.?]

- @freebie_ko_cost
- @freebie_ko_firewall
- @freebie_ko_tactical

